2. ITEM 1, BOARD B'S COOLERS (E11-40, R-190): a per-slot TPS61089 step-up to 12 V behind an eFuse
  output 11.508 / 11.962 / 12.430 V (VREF and the 1 % divider, FB leakage), inside the fan's 10.8 to 13.2 V: YES
  fsw 498.1 kHz at 5.1 V in (Equation 3); duty 0.6376 at efficiency 0.85; RO 70.4 Ohm at the rated 0.17 A
  inductor at the rated current: DC 0.539 A, ripple 2.013 A, peak 1.545 A (4.9 V in, the highest output, L -30 %, fsw -10 %, efficiency 0.80)
  inductor at the eFuse's highest limit 0.538 A: DC 1.706 A, ripple 2.013 A, peak 2.713 A; ILIM 7.3 to 8.9 A over both, Isat 11.0 A over ILIM's 8.9 A maximum
  RHP zero 313 kHz; the crossover limit min(fsw/10, fRHPZ/5) 49.8 kHz; the chosen 10 kHz under it
  COMP: Equation 17 gives R5 23.8 k at CO 33 uF effective (ASSUMPTION), drawn 23.7 k; Equation 18 C5 49.0 nF, drawn 47 nF; Equation 19 C6 7.0 pF, under 10 pF: open
  the crossover with R5 23.7 k against the effective output capacitance: 22 uF 15.0 kHz, 33 uF 10.0 kHz, 66 uF 5.0 kHz
  eFuse ILM 1.87 k: 0.448 / 0.494 / 0.538 A, INFERRED (the wider neighbouring row's tolerance); OVLO 100 k over 10 k cuts at 12.64 to 13.67 V, 0.21 V over the rail's highest; the boost's own OVP 12.7 to 13.6 V
  power, the fan row: pwr_budget.py's cooler row 0.36 / 0.51 / 0.56 W per slot (a representative 30 mm 5 V fan, not the pick); the pick prints 2.0 W at full speed
  choice (a), a step-up per slot (SELECTED): 2.353 W on +5V_Sn per slot at full speed, 0.461 A at 5.1 V (0.480 A at 4.9 V), +0.353 W of conversion per slot; the three 7.56 W at VBAT behind the slot converters (record l9pwr's R9 on each slot rail's own converter; round 2 printed 7.84 W on a flat 0.90)
  choice (b), one 12 V feed from board A over the bay harness: the three 6.74 W at VBAT (board A's converter at 0.89, an ASSUMPTION); (b) is 0.82 W lower at full speed, 0.23 W at the budget's 0.56 W a fan

