2c. ROUND 4: L9P-F02'S FOCUSED CHECK (the owner's questions 1 to 5; record l9pwr's rails parsed; the cooler's rows from Sanyo Denki's San Ace catalogue C1152B001 '25.10, held back)
  1. THE TWO MARGINS: what each figure is
    +0.129 A (round 3's margin)            +0.129 A; state: PS-BUSY and PS-ALLTX at HIGH (every load at its maximum at once);
      boundary: the AP64500 U4's output (slot side): the CM5 8.0 W, the card 9.1 W, the NVMe and switch 3.99 W and the switch core 0.676 W through board B's bucks at their curve, the fan at 1.4 W (70 % of 2.0 W, the linear bound) over the step-up's 0.85; 24.844 W / 5.1 V = 4.871 A against 5 A
    +0.019 A (the declared 4.981 A)        +0.019 A; state: no state: a declaration board B's intent.rail judges;
      boundary: board B's _SLOT_LOADS rows on +5V_S1 (CM5 1.6, U103 2.2, U104 0.7, U105 0.15, U116 0.001 A) and the fan's row 0.33 A (1.4 W / 0.85 / 5.0 V) summed, 4.981 A against the rail's declared 5.0 A peak (intent.rail refuses over 1.02 x, 5.100 A: +0.119 A to the refusal)
    the same state at the least voltage    -0.118 A; state: PS-BUSY at HIGH, the AP64500's least output less the rail's whole drop;
      boundary: 24.844 W / 4.854 V = 5.118 A: VFB 0.792 V on the 1 % divider gives 4.953 V, less 2 % 4.854 V; every load behind a converter draws its power, so its current rises as its voltage falls
    each slot-side current at HIGH (5.1 V) beside board B's declared row: CM5 slot 1 (8.0 W) 1.569 A (row 1.60); card buck U103 (9.1 W) 1.959 A (row 2.20); NVMe and switch 3.3 V buck U104 (3.99 W) 0.865 A (row 0.70); switch core buck U105 (0.676 W) 0.156 A (row 0.15); the fan 0.323 A at the 70 % bound against its row 0.33 A
    the two sums are of different things (a load's maximum at its state; a load's declared row), and neither bounds the other
    VERDICT: NOT A MARGIN. +0.129 A holds only at the nominal 5.1 V (the divider's nominal 5.088 V); at the AP64500's least output 4.953 V less the rail's 2 % drop, 4.854 V at the loads, the same state reads -0.118 A. 0.019 A is the declaration's distance from the source's 5 A rating, in no state
